            <note corresp="#d24-f3" n="3" xml:id="d24-f3-content">
                <p>For details on the establishment of the ad hoc subcommittee (Resolution 276 of
                    January 30), its recommendations, and actions taken by the Security Council and
                    General Assembly, see <hi rendition="#italic">Yearbook of the United Nations,
                        1970</hi>, pp. 734–746.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
